L3NvdXJjZS9wZGYvcGRmLWZvbnQuYwpAQCAtNTU0LDYgKzU1NCw4IEBAIHBkZl9sb2FkX2VtYmVk
ZGVkX2ZvbnQoZnpfY29udGV4dCAqY3R4LCBwZGZfZG9jdW1lbnQgKmRvYywgcGRmX2ZvbnRfZGVz
YyAqZm9udGRlCiAJdW5zaWduZWQgY2hhciAqZGF0YTsKIAlzaXplX3Qgc2l6ZTsKIAorCWZ6X3Zh
